    "updated_at": "2019-04-27T21:13:57Z",
    "body": "Oh re-reading my own comment, I guess `<img onerror>` doesn't trigger the load if the `<img>` is not connected, I guess that's what @annevk was arguing?\r\n\r\nIs there another precedent for something like this?",
